      "title": "Letterboxd review of No Time to Die",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"No Time to Die\"] Nice and harmless comedy from Ghana with somewhat awkward actors and unfitting dialogues. A hearse driver is looking for a bride. But no decent woman wants to marry a hearse driver. The entire plot revolves around whether he manages to win over a woman he likes and then marry her.The movie is in English, which makes watching it much more comfortable. Ghana seems to have an alcohol problem.If I hadn't already seen some really good films from Sub-Saharan Cinema, I might be a little more generous here, but NO TIME TO DIE is certainly not great art.boxd.it/i1Ug0",
