      "title": "Letterboxd review of No Time to Die",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"No Time to Die\"] Genuinely want to find more about King Ampaw - he studies with some of the greatest German filmmakers of the 70s, makes a film that is consistently referenced in Western writing about African Cinema (Kukurantumi, Road to Accra) in 1983, then falls out of the world until this stellar comedy 20+ years later. The film is hilarious - a great, rye comedy. So grateful for ArtMattan Films for making it available!",
